data: {"sequence_number":129,"type":"response.output_text.done","content_index":0,"item_id":"msg_40f8ec34-e098-9970-bd98-df60b074af5d","output_index":6,"text":"**The current latest LTS release of Node.js is 26.13.0 (codename Lithium), released on October 28, 2026.**[[1]](https://github.com/nodejs/node/releases/latest)[[2]](https://nodejs.org/en/about/previous-releases) **This release marks the transition of the 26.x line into Active LTS (with support until April 2029) and is the newest LTS version ahead of the still-supported but older 24.x and 22.x lines.**[[3]](https://endoflife.date/nodejs)\n\nSources: https://nodejs.org/en/about/previous-releases and https://github.com/nodejs/node/releases/latest.","logprobs":[]}

